skilletor: source "shared" in the user config (${HOME}/.claude/skilletor.json) gives its only "git", "url" or "local", and the entry in ${PROJECT}/.claude/skilletor.local.json has none: config load would refuse that entry once this one is gone. Remove that entry first (edit ${PROJECT}/.claude/skilletor.local.json by hand), or give it a "git", "url" or "local" of its own; nothing was changed.
